000363r 1               
000363r 1               ; Writes the disk command in A, with NEWBANK selected if HAVEBANK; the bank
000363r 1               ; selected before is selected again afterwards, whatever the result
000363r 1               diskbank:
000363r 1  48                   pha
000364r 1  AD 20 D0             lda BANK
